    <briefdescription>
<para>Summarizes multiple retrieved documents before context injection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage (default AUTO strategy, no explicit LLM needed for tests): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_document_summarizer_1a91e601d7076ffeab3ae1e4448186754f" kindref="member">DocumentSummarizer</ref><sp/>summarizer;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>summarizer.summarizeMultiple(docs,<sp/>query);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>inject<sp/>result.combined_summary<sp/>into<sp/>the<sp/>LLM<sp/>prompt</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Usage with explicit config: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">DocumentSummarizerConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.strategy<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="structthemis_1_1rag_1_1_document_summarizer_config_1a11ebda516e34876c762b430999e57999a1184fc314b69e4f95e8065c460b2b60d" kindref="member">DocumentSummarizerConfig::Strategy::EXTRACTIVE</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_summary_chars<sp/>=<sp/>1000;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.max_sentences_per_doc<sp/>=<sp/>3;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_document_summarizer_1a91e601d7076ffeab3ae1e4448186754f" kindref="member">DocumentSummarizer</ref><sp/>summarizer(cfg);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Performance targets:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>EXTRACTIVE: &lt;5 ms for 20 documents of 500 chars each</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ABSTRACTIVE: latency depends on the connected LLM engine </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
